:"Management API OpenAPI docs","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_service_token","label":"Management API service token authentication","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Best for server-to-server operations in your own workspace; token created in Prisma Console workspace settings and sent as Bearer auth; workspace service-token creation returns the complete token value exactly once."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_oauth_flow","label":"Management API OAuth 2.0 flow","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Best for acting on behalf of users across workspaces; redirect user to https://auth.prisma.io/authorize, receive code on callback, exchange code at https://auth.prisma.io/token."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_resource_model","label":"Management API resource model","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Workspace -> Project -> Branch -> Database hierarchy; branches are a first-class resource and branch-scoped env/databases are how preview isolation works."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_database_resource","label":"Management API database resource","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Databases, usage, backups, restore, connections, and connection rotation; connection create/rotate responses reveal credentials once, so store the URL immediately; backup records are incremental."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_sdk_management_api_sdk","label":"@prisma/management-api-sdk","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api-sdk.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"Typed API integration with optional OAuth and token refresh; reduces errors in production provisioning flows. The Platform API evolves independently from Prisma ORM, so inspect the installed package's generated api.d.ts for exact paths and shapes."},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_sdk_create_client","label":"createManagementApiClient()","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api-sdk.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_sdk_create_sdk","label":"createManagementApiSdk()","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api-sdk.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null},{"id":"_agents_skills_prisma_postgres_references_management_api_sdk_token_storage","label":"TokenStorage interface","file_type":"concept","source_file":"/Users/sadegh/Elajgar/.agents/skills/prisma-postgres/references/management-api-sdk.md","source_location":null,"source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor